---
---

<section id="planos" class="py-20 relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0a0e1a] via-[#0d1428] to-[#0a0e1a]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Cabeçalho -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        <span>💎 Transparência Absoluta</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Acesso Completo. <span class="gradient-text-indigo">Sem Contratos Abusivos</span>.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Chega de comprometer R$ 2.500 no limite do cartão em cursos impessoais. No Fluente no Mundo você tem um plano acessível, transparente e com liberdade total.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards de Planos -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Plano Mensal (Acesso Flexível) -->
      <div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between relative">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
              Assinatura Flexível
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Cancele quando quiser</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white">
            Plano Mensal
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1 mb-6">
            Ideal para quem busca flexibilidade máxima e deseja testar o método mês a mês.
          </p>

          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-white/10">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">R$</span>
            <span class="text-5xl font-heading font-black text-white">39</span>
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-300">,90</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">/mês</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Benefícios Inclusos -->
          <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Acesso a todas as <strong>Formações Essenciais</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Aulas ao Vivo semanais</strong> às quartas-feiras</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Canal <strong>SOS Professora</strong> em até 48h</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Vocabulário & Sistema SRS (3 etapas)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Vivência Global (Séries, Filmes e Músicas)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Certificados Modulares a cada 3 meses</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Garantia incondicional de 7 dias</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://alunos.fluentenomundo.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-secondary w-full text-center text-sm font-semibold !py-3.5"
        >
          Matricular no Mensal (R$ 39,90)
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Plano Anual (Melhor Custo-Benefício & Destaque) -->
      <div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 border-indigo-500/60 shadow-glow-indigo flex flex-col justify-between relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#141d3b] to-[#0f172e]">
        
        <!-- Selo de Mais Popular -->
        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-blue-500 text-white text-[11px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase shadow-md">
          ⭐ Mais Escolhido · 2 Meses Grátis
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-300 bg-indigo-500/20 border border-indigo-500/30 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
              Formação Contínua
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-bold">Economize 20%</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white">
            Plano Anual Global
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1 mb-6">
            O pacote definitivo para quem tem compromisso real com a fluência e quer garantir todas as formações.
          </p>

          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">12x de</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">R$</span>
            <span class="text-5xl font-heading font-black text-white">33</span>
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-300">,25</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">/mês</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-white/10">
            ou R$ 399,00 à vista no PIX com desconto (equivalente a R$ 33/mês).
          </p>

          <!-- Benefícios Inclusos -->
          <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-indigo-400 font-bold">★</span>
              <span><strong>TUDO do Plano Mensal incluso</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Acesso a todas as <strong>Formações Complementares</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Acesso liberado à <strong>Jornada Poliglota</strong> (12 idiomas)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Biblioteca de Ebooks e Materiais Premium para download</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Acesso prioritário às novas masterclasses e workshops</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>4 Certificados trimestrais ao longo do ano</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Garantia incondicional blindada de 7 dias</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://alunos.fluentenomundo.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-primary w-full text-center text-sm font-semibold !py-4 !shadow-glow-indigo"
        >
          Garantir Vaga no Anual com Desconto ➔
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Dúvidas sobre Matrícula / WhatsApp -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">
      <span>Ficou com alguma dúvida sobre pagamentos ou emissão de nota fiscal?</span>
      <a href="/contato" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 font-semibold ml-1 underline">
        Fale diretamente com nosso atendimento
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
